#: 1895e00aff1545ff986bf49c305ae60b
msgid "From R3.0 release candidate"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/3_0/release-notes.rst:67
#: 647fb0130525434abda18528d92b5a8d
msgid ""
"If you are using Qubes R3.0rc1, R3.0rc2 or R3.0rc3, just install system "
"updates, there is no special steps required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/3_0/release-notes.rst:70
#: d319d4a8d2cd4508825c99d867cc7c03
msgid "From R2.0 or earlier"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/3_0/release-notes.rst:73
#: 0a162748a47f463494af009780f8544e
msgid ""
"The easiest and safest way to upgrade to Qubes R3.0 is to install it from "
"scratch and use :doc:`qubes backup and restore tools </user/how-to-guides/"
"how-to-back-up-restore-and-migrate>` for migrating of all of the user VMs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/3_0/release-notes.rst:75
#: 4503c33aaaa8458bad1edf0626c4d5cb
msgid ""
